#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:9
#: b697d9880fb3403ea32d1e7685d68cd1
msgid ""
"Older versions of Pixhawk use an early version of the STM32F427 chip (RevA, "
"RevY and Rev1). A hardware bug is present in these chips that limit the "
"flash memory to 1 MB. Any boards containing this chip cannot include all "
"ArduPilot features due to this limitation. See :ref:`Firmware Limitations "
"<common-limited_firmware>` for details."
msgstr ""
"旧版本的 Pixhawk 使用早期版本的 STM32F427 芯片（RevA、RevY 和 Rev1）。这些芯片存在硬件缺陷，限制闪存为 1 "
"MB。包含此芯片的板卡由于此限制无法包含所有 ArduPilot 功能。详情请参阅 :ref:`固件限制 <common-"
"limited_firmware>`。"

