"**Virtual Pin 3 and Power connector Pin 3**: power management connector "
"current pin, accepts up to 3.3V, usually attached to a power module with "
"17:1 scaling"
msgstr "**虚拟引脚 3 和电源连接器引脚 3**：电源管理连接器电流引脚，最高接受 3.3V，通常连接到具有 17:1 缩放比例的电源模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:643
#: 25dd44b3e7fd43f8b480595727e03fe3 81da773a31384ef59c802aa43b80b620
#: 86e68bd96c2a45039d3ef38d6aa0fe8d 8b2e08c132b944639928232d0ebec0a2
