msgid ""
"**Virtual Pin 4 and (No connector Pin)**: VCC 5V rail sensing. This virtual "
"pin reads the voltage on the 5V supply rail. It is used to provide the "
"HWSTATUS.Vcc reading that ground stations use to display 5V status"
msgstr ""
"**虚拟引脚 4 和（无连接器引脚）**：VCC 5V 轨检测。此虚拟引脚读取 5V 供电轨的电压。用于提供地面站显示 5V 状态的 "
"HWSTATUS.Vcc 读数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:648
#: 16da560575c44755b7ccbb2184a56912 4a2a64f368aa49e29ad42c2d208baa9d
#: 642f097bca004588bddf04a2177db05e 666061616698421c85c07cb0bf3497ee
#: 78a60c5377a34b14ae90ec92765173e3 b404877ea61347b9bdb857f697bf224b
msgid ""
"**Virtual Pin 13 and ADC 3.3V connector Pin 4**: This takes a max of 3.3V. "
"May be used for sonar or other analog sensors."
msgstr "**虚拟引脚 13 和 ADC 3.3V 连接器引脚 4**：最大 3.3V。可用于声纳或其他模拟传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:651
#: 085176b9cf4740c2ac83f373c146a4c4 401180beaa52467582f362ba85310dd1
#: 71dde1d121364954846d87d9418a6593 998b84b248e84b70b7badd3e74655523
#: 99bca2bd29674fa49cb3252610fdbd1e e84d40946c654447b57a2fc199fe22a2
msgid ""
"**Virtual Pin 14 and ADC 3.3V connector Pin 2**: This takes a max of 3.3V. "
"May be used for second sonar or other analog sensor."
msgstr "**虚拟引脚 14 和 ADC 3.3V 连接器引脚 2**：最大 3.3V。可用于第二路声纳或其他模拟传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:654
#: 339b04e7f3574ff8a5d4af533090703d 343f93d07e424d24976ffa93eee95542
#: 4358857c98fc45f0ae088e868b29544f a2a81bfeb5924998b6d7c73068ee32f2
#: c1a3d022bcda4ed585690de427429b97 d931b3f2391e4db886aa99ca390fff54
msgid ""
"**Virtual Pin 15 and ADC 6.6V connector Pin 2**: analog airspeed sensor "
"port. This has 2:1 scaling builtin, so can take up to 6.6v analog inputs. "
"Usually used for analog airspeed, but may be used for analog sonar or other "
"analog sensors."
msgstr ""
"**虚拟引脚 15 和 ADC 6.6V 连接器引脚 2**：模拟空速传感器端口。内置 2:1 缩放，可接受最高 6.6V "
"模拟输入。通常用于模拟空速，但也可用于模拟声纳或其他模拟传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:662
#: 255a6ff40fd34f9397482e8ff3a7cc8c 2abda051e6bb45618c5965567b53e1ec
#: 4b6661359d7544578cdab2aefafa70cb 81dc456e21b6495a8368e9f30ae0d422
#: 8868e398034a49f58da5be053302e4bb 91ef8dd4f35f4588807c575c552fc13f
msgid ""
"**Virtual Pin 102**: Servo power rail voltage. This is an internal "
"measurement of the servo rail voltage made by the IO board within the "
"Pixhawk. It has 3:1 scaling, allowing it to measure up to 9.9V."
msgstr ""
"**虚拟引脚 102**：舵机电源轨电压。这是由 Pixhawk 内部 IO 板对舵机轨电压的内部测量。具有 3:1 缩放比例，可测量最高 9.9V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:666
#: 4314e6948b7b47bfb180124599d5ec66 6830d736c00f4cc9aab61754e3a4c067
#: 80b289cc451a432fb9a5e0ee9c34314b 9317a62c914045eaad1f2cc93dd0d509
#: 9df14a202f7942efb6c93c7b33b413d6 eedcde4e11574924a8aa8eecaa599c62
msgid ""
"**Virtual Pin 103**: RSSI (Received Signal Strength Input) input pin voltage"
" (SBus connector output pin). This is the voltage measured by the RSSI input"
" pin on the SBUS-out connector (the bottom pin of the 2nd last servo "
"connector on the 14 connector servo rail)."
msgstr ""
"**虚拟引脚 103**：RSSI（接收信号强度输入）输入引脚电压（SBus 连接器输出引脚）。这是由 SBUS 输出连接器上的 RSSI "
"输入引脚测量的电压（14 个连接器舵机轨上倒数第二个舵机连接器的底部引脚）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:671
#: 3c204218647545778de59797953be1fe 46dbaa35d72d4fe788a73910c5dcef86
#: 641058e6a3d343d3931bf90c7ed5afc1 aa828001d8af4e0fb76e4d7dbfb2c787
#: ce0d983899ff4e7486a461a91f4774de e99f7c6100234de892cb99a9fe44966e
msgid ""
"This can alternatively serve as SBus out by setting the ``BRD_SBUS_OUT`` "
"parameter ( :ref:`Copter <copter:BRD_SBUS_OUT>`, :ref:`Plane "
"<plane:BRD_SBUS_OUT>`, :ref:`Rover <rover:BRD_SBUS_OUT>`)."
msgstr ""
"也可通过设置 ``BRD_SBUS_OUT`` 参数（:ref:`Copter <copter:BRD_SBUS_OUT>`、:ref:`Plane "
"<plane:BRD_SBUS_OUT>`、:ref:`Rover <rover:BRD_SBUS_OUT>`）将其用作 SBus 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:681
#: 11dfa762c9fc4028b1fd2e874229a0ac 2ab4218424ff4e26afcd30663237eb3d
#: 804603daa9e54da5b1aefde311ec4c66 8576411f69864c25bb346a136938b735
#: e71dc7f518944c8c955e219c2e278a68 fd6f53066fa84a3e818178ad4086547c
msgid "Pixhawk digital outputs and inputs (Virtual Pins 50-55)"
msgstr "Pixhawk 数字输出和输入（虚拟引脚 50-55）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:683
#: 80ece8fbe0324185940b6311901a62ba 940243ee36574541817e37caa9b798b0
#: b09f5c7a51b1406e9fe5ec6dbbe0fed6 b3fd268a96494e29875590eed7ab701e
#: bde5190409414a8a8f905670501b4549 cd2576d90e6842fc8e38fc7ff8df1a05
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk has no dedicated digital output or input pins on its DF13 "
"connectors, but you can assign up to 6 of the \"AUX SERVO\" connectors to be"
" digital GPIO outputs/inputs. These are the first 6 of the 14 three-pin "
"servo connectors on the end of the board. They are marked as AUX servo pins "
"1 - 6 on the silkscreen as seen above."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk 的 DF13 连接器上没有专用的数字输出或输入引脚，但您可以将最多 6 个「AUX SERVO」连接器分配为数字 GPIO "
"输出/输入。这些是板卡末端 14 个三针舵机连接器中的前 6 个。如上图所示，它们在丝印上标记为 AUX 舵机引脚 1-6。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:689
#: 21520e37457f41dc9cd956411b20e886 2acb6dc887344a639359be1cfd45d661
#: 2dcaff30926745a5a43f58da653ccc25 637505af86f54a8992bb17f8e694bcb2
#: c74d055c9ea342dc8f8cda7d08656f30 cda3164db86348cdbeb6298bd64aed51
msgid ""
"To set the number of these pins that are available as digital "
"inputs/outputs, set the ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` parameter. On Pixhawk this "
"defaults to 4, which means the first 4 AUX connectors are for servos (PWM) "
"and the last 2 are for digital inputs/outputs. If you set ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` "
"to 0 then you would have 6 virtual digital pins and still have 8 PWM outputs"
" on the rest of the connector."
msgstr ""
"要设置可用作数字输入/输出的引脚数量，设置 ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` 参数。在 Pixhawk 上默认为 4，意味着前 4 个 AUX "
"连接器用于舵机（PWM），后 2 个用于数字输入/输出。如果将 ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` 设置为 0，则有 6 "
"个虚拟数字引脚，但其余连接器上仍有 8 路 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:696
#: 3150f0fa5da74428a838e37b91f85dc9 6d281cf6123b49b2a442cd8ede8686f8
#: 6f8d64e8b6aa4fb4ac65fdeef4fb59d5 8c1063d9b37046468c496a8b1a3c9cf0
#: b3a0740383484f038c46361f0d748159 e970d4f35e444b689c8e83f910c16ec1
msgid ""
"in firmware versions 4.2 and later, the method for setting a PWM/SERVO/MOTOR"
" output to be a GPIO function is changed. Instead of ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` being"
" used, the individual ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` parameter is merely set to \"-1\"."
" If set to \"0\", it remains a PWM output, unassigned to a function, and "
"outputs that output's trim value when board safety is not active. If the "
"servo function is being \"mirrored\" to a remote device, as in the case of a"
" DroneCAN or KDECAN ESC, then in order to change the autopilot board's "
"corresponding output pin to be a GPIO, but allow the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to "
"still be assigned to the remote device, the "
":ref:`SERVO_GPIO_MASK<SERVO_GPIO_MASK>` parameter can be used to assign the "
"board pin to be a GPIO without affecting the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` assignment "
"for the remote device."
msgstr ""
"在固件版本4.2及更高版本中，将PWM/SERVO/MOTOR输出设置为GPIO功能的方法已更改。不再使用 "
"``BRD_PWM_COUNT``，而是将对应的 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` "
"参数设置为「-1」即可。如果设置为「0」，则该输出仍为PWM输出，未分配功能，在飞控安全开关未激活时输出该输出的微调值。如果舵机功能被「镜像」到远程设备（例如DroneCAN或KDECAN"
" ESC），则为了将飞控板对应输出引脚改为GPIO但仍让 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 分配给远程设备，可使用 "
":ref:`SERVO_GPIO_MASK<SERVO_GPIO_MASK>` 参数将飞控板引脚设为GPIO，同时不影响远程设备的 "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 分配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-overview.rst:698
#: 0f3400bbaac34b3db81639185e9fa322 11f42538fb5f4dd7840f3792c21b5044
