msgid ""
"By default, the pins are digital outputs as outlined above. A digital pin "
"will instead be a digital input if it is assigned to a parameter that "
"represents a digital input. For example, setting "
":ref:`CAM1_FEEDBAK_PIN<CAM1_FEEDBAK_PIN>` to 50 will make pin 50 the digital"
" input that receives a signal from the camera when a picture has been taken."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，引脚为如上所述的数字输出。如果数字引脚被分配给表示数字输入的参数，则该引脚将成为数字输入。例如，将 "
":ref:`CAM1_FEEDBAK_PIN<CAM1_FEEDBAK_PIN>` 设置为 50 将使引脚 50 "
"成为数字输入，用于接收相机拍照时发送的信号。"

