#: d91637998fb34d6c88825f6213f46626
msgid ""
"A hardware bug is present in these chips that limit the flash memory to 1 "
"MB. Any boards containing this chip cannot include all ArduPilot features "
"due to this limitation. See :ref:`Firmware Limitations <common-"
"limited_firmware>` for details."
msgstr ""
"这些芯片存在一个硬件缺陷，将闪存限制为 1 MB。由于该限制，任何搭载此芯片的板卡都无法包含 ArduPilot 的全部功能。详见 :ref:`固件限制"
" <common-limited_firmware>`。"
